<i>in the form of lies, divisions, \Nand mistakes.</i>

1309
01:21:16,997 --> 01:21:19,040
<i>We need to find a way to cooperate</i>

1310
01:21:19,040 --> 01:21:21,084
<i>while realizing foreign policy</i>

1311
01:21:21,084 --> 01:21:23,044
<i>can't be run by committee.</i>

1312
01:21:24,045 --> 01:21:26,089
<i>And I believe there's now \Nthe growing sense</i>

1313
01:21:27,007 --> 01:21:30,010
<i>that we can accomplish \Nmore by cooperating.</i>

1314
01:21:31,011 --> 01:21:32,053
<i>And, in the end,</i>

1315
01:21:32,053 --> 01:21:35,015
<i>this may be the eventual \Nblessing in disguise</i>

1316
01:21:35,056 --> 01:21:36,099
<i>to come out of the Iran-Contra mess.</i>

1317
01:21:37,017 --> 01:21:38,101
How can he lie like that?

1318
01:21:40,103 --> 01:21:42,063
- How can he pull that shit? \N- What shit?

1319
01:21:42,063 --> 01:21:44,065
Now where do we have reservations at?

1320
01:21:45,025 --> 01:21:47,110
I mean, I'm not really hungry, but \NI'd like to have reservations someplace.

1321
01:21:47,986 --> 01:21:49,070
How can you be so fucking...

1322
01:21:51,031 --> 01:21:52,032
I don't know...

1323
01:21:52,032 --> 01:21:53,033
cool about it?

1324
01:21:53,074 --> 01:21:55,076
Some guys are just born cool, I guess.

1325
01:22:01,082 --> 01:22:03,001
Bateman.

1326
01:22:04,044 --> 01:22:05,086
What are you so fucking zany about?

1327
01:22:05,086 --> 01:22:08,006
I'm just a happy camper.

1328
01:22:09,049 --> 01:22:10,050
Rockin' and a-rollin'!

1329
01:22:12,052 --> 01:22:14,012
Oh, brother! Look,

1330
01:22:14,012 --> 01:22:17,057
he presents himself \Nas this harmless old codger, but

1331
01:22:18,016 --> 01:22:19,017
inside...

1332
01:22:19,017 --> 01:22:20,060
But inside...

1333
01:22:21,102 --> 01:22:23,104
<i>But inside doesn't matter.</i>

1334
01:22:25,023 --> 01:22:26,107
Inside? Yes? Inside?

1335
01:22:27,025 --> 01:22:29,027
Believe it or not, Bryce, \Nwe're actually listening to you.

1336
01:22:29,027 --> 01:22:30,070
Come on, Bateman,

1337
01:22:30,070 --> 01:22:31,112
what do you think?

1338
01:22:34,074 --> 01:22:35,992
Whatever.

1339
01:22:36,034 --> 01:22:38,078
Whose moronic idea was it \Nto order dry beers?

1340
01:22:39,079 --> 01:22:41,039
I need a scotch.

1341
01:22:57,055 --> 01:22:59,015
<i>There are no more barriers to cross.</i>

1342
01:23:00,058 --> 01:23:04,020
<i>All I have in common \Nwith the uncontrollable and the insane,</i>

1343
01:23:04,020 --> 01:23:06,022
<i>the vicious and the evil,</i>

1344
01:23:06,022 --> 01:23:09,067
<i>all the mayhem I have caused \Nand my utter indifference toward it,</i>

1345
01:23:09,109 --> 01:23:11,069
<i>I have now surpassed.</i>

1346
01:23:15,031 --> 01:23:17,033
<i>My pain is constant and sharp,</i>

1347
01:23:17,992 --> 01:23:20,078
<i>and I do not hope \Nfor a better world for anyone.</i>

1348
01:23:21,079 --> 01:23:25,041
<i>In fact, I want my pain \Nto be inflicted on others.</i>

1349
01:23:26,042 --> 01:23:28,044
<i>I want no one to escape.</i>

1350
01:23:30,088 --> 01:23:32,090
<i>But even after admitting this,</i>

1351
01:23:33,008 --> 01:23:34,092
<i>there is no catharsis.</i>

1352
01:23:35,051 --> 01:23:37,095
<i>My punishment continues to elude me,</i>

1353
01:23:38,054 --> 01:23:40,098
<i>and I gain no deeper knowledge of myself.</i>

1354
01:23:41,057 --> 01:23:44,060
<i>No new knowledge can be \Nextracted from my telling.</i>

1355
01:23:45,061 --> 01:23:48,106
<i>This confession has meant nothing.</i>

